<title>USA: Arconium hikes indium price to $8.10/troy ounce.</title>
<headline>Arconium hikes indium price to $8.10/troy ounce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arconium said it raised its indium price to $8.10 per troy ounce from $7.00, effective March 19.</p>
<p>The company's previous price change was March 4, from $6.53 to $7.00.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
